{"data":{"body":"**P2:** Both views retain this new root until `onInvocationEnd`, but `DurableExecutor` still serializes the handler result\u2014and may checkpoint an oversized result\u2014before firing that hook. If output serialization or that checkpoint fails, the invocation exits without ending or flushing the root, and the next invocation overwrites its reference. Ensure post-handler failures also fire the end lifecycle before propagating, and add failing output-SerDes/checkpoint tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc772w0B","finding_digest":"9bc7deed9eb741e2d3ab75b0d657ec8eeaaede88d64b95ccb717ab4f9a0b17a2","finding_id":"arf_v1_tpd553m6w5a6fu5lowynmv7mr3","finding_key":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/otelpluginsupport.java::startexecutionroot::post-handler-end-pairing","identity_key":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/otelpluginsupport.java::startexecutionroot::post-handler-end-pairing","line":34,"observation_digest":"97d35bc5b7371736e813d6b70bdb052aaca06c9f4547b689816d62da27b28bfc","observation_id":"aro_v1_s7jvxrnxg4ltn2at223qxwyffk","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/OtelPluginSupport.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-09T00:17:30Z","review_id":"arr_v1_bjy43jiupfo56ejqexsqsf3lxe","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"2adc34c4d51c6f4dc566985cb74ad6c24bae61f1","reviewer":"codex","start_line":34,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_ct7p4uopnoykxrfbsllomzws7d","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T00:17:30Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
